{UTF-8}
Persistent Pollution= INTEG (
	Pollution Appearance-Pollution Assimilation,
		25)
	~	Pollution units (millions)
	~	World3-03's persistent pollution sector with its assimilation half-life multiplier: a ratio SD Lab's format cannot hold (kept to test that the importer says so).
	|
Pollution Appearance=
	DELAY3(Pollution Generation, Transmission Delay)
	~	Pollution units (millions)/Year
	~	
	|
Pollution Assimilation=
	Persistent Pollution/(1.4*Assimilation Half Life)
	~	Pollution units (millions)/Year
	~	
	|
Assimilation Half Life=
	Assimilation Half Life 1970*Assimilation Half Life Multiplier(Persistent Pollution/Pollution 1970)
	~	Year
	~	
	|
Assimilation Half Life Multiplier(
	[(1,0)-(1001,50)],(1,1),(251,11),(501,21),(751,31),(1001,41))
	~	Dmnl
	~	AHLM
	|
Pollution Generation=
	30+15*SIN(2*3.14159265358979*Time/80)+10*STEP(1, 60)
	~	Pollution units (millions)/Year
	~	
	|
Pollution 1970=
	136
	~	Pollution units (millions)
	~	PPOL70
	|
Transmission Delay=
	20
	~	Year
	~	
	|
Assimilation Half Life 1970=
	1.5
	~	Year
	~	
	|
